  "identity": "Squat rooted-wood guardian with a broad knotted oak torso, mossy bark mask face, two short branching root antlers and small amber eyes. Huge root mitten hands, short splayed root feet, thick mushroom-and-moss shoulder pads. Cream shelf fungi and muted olive growth; no giant umbrella cap. Ancient stubborn groundskeeper with enormous brow and tiny mouth.",
